    "message": "feat: ship full case context and an operational quote rule\n\nAI-assisted revision of the single-response harness, approved by the maintainer\nas configuration 27a34c7f05d374bac7752be9c774c77886f4432aa466db7c1c22b07e97634ece.\n\n- packet builder ships every frozen context source file whole, up to four files,\n  with a 320 KiB allowance; files are never truncated, only listed in\n  omitted_context\n- harness allowance matches the builder and a test fails if they diverge\n- skill and system message define a verbatim quote operationally, and state that\n  a fact answering a candidate question counts as supplied\n- docs and AGENTS.md updated; pre-registration recorded before any dispatch\n\nMeasured offline: all 22 packets fit, all ship their frozen files completely,\nlargest 257,613 B. 89 tests pass and local verification passes. Inputs,\nexpectations, adversarial cases, envelope version and scoring are unchanged.",
